DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/email/routing/suppression/{suppression_id}
Deletes an email suppression for the specified zone.
Required: zone_id (path); suppression_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/email/sending/suppression/{suppression_id}
Deletes an email suppression for the specified zone.
Required: zone_id (path); suppression_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/email/routing/rules/{rule_identifier}
Delete a specific routing rule.
Required: rule_identifier (path); zone_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/email/routing/rules/{rule_identifier}
Get information for a specific routing rule already created.
Required: rule_identifier (path); zone_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/email/routing/rules/{rule_identifier}
Update actions and matches, or enable/disable specific routing rules. Forward actions require exactly one verified destination address.
Required: rule_identifier (path); zone_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/email/sending/subdomains/{subdomain_id}
Disables sending on a subdomain and removes its DNS records. If routing is still active on the subdomain, only sending is disabled.
Required: subdomain_id (path); zone_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/email/sending/subdomains/{subdomain_id}
Gets information for a specific sending subdomain.
Required: subdomain_id (path); zone_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/email/sending/subdomains/{subdomain_id}
Updates the activity-log preview preference for a sending subdomain.
Required: subdomain_id (path); zone_id (path); body (body)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/email/routing/suppression/{suppression_id}
Retrieves a single email suppression for the specified zone.
Required: zone_id (path); suppression_id (path)

